---
source: crates/vextor-app/src/app/keys.rs
expression: "sheet(OperatingSystem::Windows)"
---
New: Ctrl+N
Open: Ctrl+O
Import: Ctrl+Shift+I
Close: Ctrl+W
Save: Ctrl+S
Save As: Ctrl+Shift+S
Export: Ctrl+Shift+E
Undo: Ctrl+Z
Redo: Ctrl+Y
Cut: Ctrl+X
Copy: Ctrl+C
Copy As SVG: Ctrl+Shift+C
Paste: Ctrl+V
Paste in Place: Ctrl+Shift+V
Duplicate: Ctrl+D
Delete: Del
Select All: Ctrl+A
Group: Ctrl+G
Ungroup: Ctrl+Shift+G
Convert to Path: Ctrl+Shift+P
Convert Text to Outlines: Ctrl+Shift+O
Fit Artboard: Ctrl+0
Actual Size: Ctrl+1
Zoom In: Ctrl+Plus
Zoom Out: Ctrl+Minus
Show Grid: Ctrl+'
Next Document: Ctrl+PageDown
Previous Document: Ctrl+PageUp
Exit: Alt+F4
Bring to Front: Ctrl+Shift+↑
Bring Forward: Ctrl+↑
Send Backward: Ctrl+↓
Send to Back: Ctrl+Shift+↓
Join: Ctrl+J
Straight ↔ Curve: C
Add Node: +
Delete Nodes: Del
